      "title": "🌟 Join the Roosh Tech Team as a Crypto Researcher! 🌟",
      "description": "Are you passionate about Web3 and Crypto? Roosh Tech is seeking part-time Crypto Researchers to join our dynamic team and explore the most exciting opportunities in the blockchain space.\n\n💻 About Us:\nAt Roosh Tech, we focus on identifying and supporting early-stage Web3 projects. With a collaborative team of founders, engineers, and investors, we analyze market trends, share insights, and contribute to the future of blockchain innovation. Visit our website to learn more: [roosh.tech/en](https://roosh.tech/en).\n\n💰 Salary and Benefits:\nEarn $900 - $1500 per week (flexible, part-time role).\n\n📍 Location:\nRemote work available.\n\n🌵 Job Requirements:\n1️⃣ A strong curiosity about the crypto and Web3 ecosystem, with a passion for exploring and learning.\n2️⃣ Understanding of blockchain trends, DAOs, and industry hot spots; ability to source first-hand information from diverse communities.\n3️⃣ Excellent analytical and writing skills, with the ability to craft detailed reports and summaries.\n4️⃣ Experience in crypto research, data analysis, or market tracking is a plus.\n5️⃣ Proficiency in English for reviewing and translating materials from English resources.\n\n🌟 Why Join Us?\n\nBe part of a forward-thinking team exploring groundbreaking Web3 projects.\nFlexible work hours, allowing you to contribute while balancing other commitments.\nOpportunities to collaborate with top-tier investors and developers.\n📩 How to Apply:\nContact us via Telegram: https://t.me/Roosh_Dmitrenko\n\nTake the next step in your crypto journey and make an impact in the future of Web3 with Roosh Tech! 🚀",
